    "reference": "In episode four, titled \"Birth Day,\" Offred learns from Ofglen that she has a wife and son and warns her about an \"Eye\" in the Waterford house. Janine is punished with the removal of her right eye after taunting Aunt Lydia, and Janine also tells Offred that her friend Moira is dead. The episode also features the destruction of St. Paul Catholic Church and the bulldozing of St. Patrick's Cathedral in Manhattan."
